[[build-collect]]
=== Collect, fold, parse and render

**STUB**: Specifies the CLI's data-flow directives: `@collect` and `@fold`,
which gather a stream into a value, and `@parse` and `@render`, which convert
between external formats and typed values. Defines buffering and when data is
materialized versus streamed. Covers how parsers and formatters are chosen, how
several renders write to separate named outputs, and the full path data takes
from input file to output.

